  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Support to TradeMark East Africa to support the implementation of the TMEA Rwanda Country Programme Strategy 2 - RDEL line.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UK will provide up to &#xA3;25m (2017 &#x2013; 2025) to support TMEA&apos;s Strategy 2 (S2) which aims to remove trade-related barriers to inclusive growth in Rwanda and the East African Community (EAC).</narrative>
